MAIN
MOVE TEMP 18 4
MOVE TEMP 19 HALLOCATE TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 4
MOVE TEMP 21 HALLOCATE TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 InheritTest_ved_TestInherit
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 23
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 24 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 24
PRINT TEMP 4
END
InheritTest_ved_TestInherit [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 25 4
MOVE TEMP 26 HALLOCATE TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 27 4
MOVE TEMP 28 HALLOCATE TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 TEMP 6
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 30 Parent_ved_Compute
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 5
MOVE TEMP 31 4
MOVE TEMP 32 HALLOCATE TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 33 4
MOVE TEMP 34 HALLOCATE TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 35 TEMP 8
HSTORE TEMP 7 0 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 36 Child_ved_Compute
HSTORE TEMP 8 0 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 7
MOVE TEMP 37 10
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 37
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
MOVE TEMP 38 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 9 )
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 38
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 12
PRINT TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 39 10
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 39
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 14 0
MOVE TEMP 40 CALL TEMP 15 ( TEMP 2 TEMP 13 )
MOVE TEMP 16 TEMP 40
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 16
PRINT TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 41 0
MOVE TEMP 17 TEMP 41

RETURN TEMP 17
END
Parent_ved_Compute [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 42 5
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 42
MOVE TEMP 43 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 43

RETURN TEMP 3
END
Child_ved_Compute [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 44 2
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 44
MOVE TEMP 45 TIMES TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 45

RETURN TEMP 3
END

